OL,3,GNEWSACCTV appeal after laptops stolen
OL,4,Afrom school
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said both men were white, with
OL,7,Fone aged between 18-21, of slim build,
OL,8,Fabout 5ft 9ins (1.75m) tall, with thick
OL,9,Fbrown curly hair. The other man was
OL,10,Faged between 21-25, of slim build,
OL,11,Fbetween 5ft 5ins-5ft 7ins (1.65m-1.70m)
OL,12,Ftall, with facial stubble.
OL,14,FA force spokesperson said: "We are keen
OL,15,Fto speak to the two men photographed as
OL,16,Fpart of our inquiry."
